{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a dev with a unique vision - &quot;To create the best darn ghost hunting/investigating simulation on Steam!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So dive into a world that's deep with lore, gadgets and ... oh yeah... Ghosts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the Whispers \u2013 Provocation is a first-person single player \u201cAuthentic Real-Life Paranormal Investigation Simulator&quot;. It's not a game looking to Jump Scare you (although it may happen so don't blink!), instead it's about truly learning about a haunted family and their past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.poster.avif?t=1758639598\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.webm?t=1758639598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.mp4?t=1758639598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Operate tools paranormal investigators use in real life to learn about the ghosts that plague this location and what binds them here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.poster.avif?t=1758639598\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.webm?t=1758639598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.mp4?t=1758639598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use provocations to coax the dead in various ways to communicate or manifest. However, beware, trying to provoke a ghost while unprepared can lead to psychological consequences that could make the investigation harder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So keep your nerves calm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.poster.avif?t=1758639598\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.webm?t=1758639598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/e095d47d206a739e029c4e6bab9dd128.mp4?t=1758639598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dare, explore this enormous four-story mansion with over 30 rooms to learn about the dark secrets it has been hiding for generations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the clues to slowly piece together the sinful past this family has endured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for all the support with my previous work on Conrad Stevenson! I hope this game shows you that I've been hard at work with stronger gameplay, better visuals, and deeper investigations! ~ Kip the dev</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stop the cycle.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/a6098481a7d4bfce675b8337dff52a6a9f433d63.jpg"},{"name":"Turn the lights on.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/a2c816c15f803e39ea844f22d65393c00deea05d.jpg"},{"name":"Be at peace.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/db4b0daf2db33c24ce767520fc4b3e3c408ba8f5.jpg"},{"name":"19 ways to die.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/8f315a78bdd389e700270ee601a06cb676469890.jpg"},{"name":"Jack of all trades.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/c2e6e837158b9f3489b4dabe5d9eab2200410730.jpg"},{"name":"I don't need a map.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/d406a03b9e34a8f16c9362d89f375982b6916df7.jpg"},{"name":"Quite the Genealogist.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/cbca05337c92462a8e165f4b51085cfe63d20c81.jpg"},{"name":"Tools of the trade.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/e73292bcc1b31583adc70c2b0ba3a428139a1523.jpg"},{"name":"I'm always cold.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/c2b112ba1a6713aa431f72e4765d236321c01384.jpg"},{"name":"Now I've heard it all.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2814680/4b9b55a93c66dc741abefa6245e35c091aa27156.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2814680?t=1758639598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2814680?t=1758639598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/4270e1ec3ab1bc1cf127a33bf1617f10b0f3f8a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758639598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/4270e1ec3ab1bc1cf127a33bf1617f10b0f3f8a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758639598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game is about investigating ghosts and the lives they had.  The ghosts in this game had tragic ends which caused them to become ghosts.  These tragic endings generally consist of subjects about murder, suicide, and substance abuse."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a dev with a unique vision - &quot;To create the best darn ghost hunting/investigating simulation on Steam!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So dive into a world that's deep with lore, gadgets and ... oh yeah... Ghosts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the Whispers \u2013 Provocation is a first-person single player \u201cAuthentic Real-Life Paranormal Investigation Simulator&quot;. It's not a game looking to Jump Scare you (although it may happen so don't blink!), instead it's about truly learning about a haunted family and their past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.poster.avif?t=1758639598\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.webm?t=1758639598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/9b7ca9e50844e8a1e2d762c2e2146e92.mp4?t=1758639598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Operate tools paranormal investigators use in real life to learn about the ghosts that plague this location and what binds them here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814680/extras/d403bdb875df548e0f6f97991f35e7ef.poster.avif?t=1758639598\" width=